"# constitution.ng

> Independent Nigerian legal reference. Published source editions, not certified current consolidated law.

This is the 1999 Constitution as published in 2004. Later amendments aren't included yet, so a section may have changed since.

## Reading and provenance
- [Browse the source edition](https://example.test/laws): Law and provision links, pinned to the published release.
- [Sources and corrections](https://example.test/about): Publisher, review boundaries, known corpus gaps and corrections.
- [Retrieval methodology](https://example.test/methodology): Dated retrieval benchmark; not a measure of answer correctness.

## Citation guidance
Cite a provision's release-pinned canonical URL, edition, citation and original source. Do not describe historical wording as current consolidated law. Explanations are not legal advice.
"
`;

